    <briefdescription>
<para>Linear-scan Hierarchical Tucker index (<ref refid="classthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_flat_h_t_index" kindref="compound">FlatHTIndex</ref>). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes exact cosine similarity for every stored entry on each query; suitable for up to ~10 000 entries at modest rank.</para>
<para>Thread safety: concurrent reads are safe; writes are serialised by an internal mutex. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
